WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.533
Just Speak to It for Mac. Sample data: fictional History and fixed test text.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:06.833
In any app, double-tap your global shortcut to start (sent here by the test driver)

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:09.800
Speak naturally. This demo plays a synthetic audio clip, not a live microphone

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.333
Tap again to stop. A test fixture returns fixed text

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:17.733
The text lands where you were typing

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:24.900
Every dictation is saved to History

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.767
Pick on-device models that keep audio on your Mac, or a cloud provider with your own key

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:34.900
Optional clean-up polishes punctuation and filler words

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.433
Just Speak to It for Mac. Download at justspeaktoit.com
